0631\\u064b\\u0627 \\u062a\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a\\u062e\\u064a\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0641\\u062d\\u0633\\u0628\\u060c \\u0628\\u0644 \\u062a\\u062e\\u0644\\u0642 \\u0623\\u064a\\u0636\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a\\u064a\\u062c\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0623\\u0643\\u062b\\u0631 \\u062a\\u0648\\u0627\\u0632\\u0646\\u0627\\u064b \\u0648\\u0645\\u0631\\u0648\\u0646\\u0629. \\u0633\\u0648\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0643\\u0646\\u062a \\u062a\\u062a\\u0637\\u0644\\u0639 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u062a\\u0642\\u0644\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062e\\u0627\\u0637\\u0631 \\u0623\\u0648 \\u062d\\u0645\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062b\\u0631\\u0648\\u062a\\u0643\\u060c \\u0641\\u0625\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u0647\\u0628 \\u0623\\u062f\\u0627\\u0629 \\u0642\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062a\\u062d\\u0642\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0646\\u0648\\u064a\\u0639 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0645\\u0627\\u0646 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0648\\u064a\\u0644.<\\/p>","tags":["\\u0630\\u0647\\u0628","\\u064a\\u0633\\u062a\\u062b\\u0645\\u0631"]}},"image":"1ae95d69-d22f-42dd-a0b8-ea980f1b91ba.webp"}','status' => '1','created_at' => '2023-12-06 10:37:01','updated_at' => '2024-10-16 15:50:02'),
            array('id' => '2','announcement_category_id' => '1','slug' => 'diversifying-your-investments-with-precious-metals','data' => '{"language":{"en":{"title":"Gold vs. Stocks: Which is Better for Long-Term Investing?","description":"<p>When it comes to long-term investing, both gold and stocks offer unique advantages, but they serve very different purposes. Gold is often seen as a hedge against inflation and economic instability, while stocks are viewed as vehicles for growth and income.<br>Gold\\u2019s primary strength lies in its stability. Over time, it tends to maintain its value, making it a reliable store of wealth, particularly during periods of market volatility. For investors seeking a way to preserve their capital in uncertain times, gold is a strong choice.<br>Stocks, on the other hand, offer the potential for higher returns over the long run. By investing in stocks, particularly those of growing companies, investors can benefit from dividends and capital appreciation. However, stocks come with higher volatility, which can be a downside during market downturns.<br>The decision between gold and stocks doesn\\u2019t have to be an either\\/or choice. Many investors use a combination of both to diversify their portfolios. Gold can act as a stabilizing force, while stocks drive growth. The right balance depends on your investment goals and risk tolerance.<\\/p>","tags":["Gold","Invest"]},"es":{"title":"Oro versus acciones: \\u00bfcu\\u00e1l es mejor para invertir a largo plazo?","description":"<p>En lo que respecta a la inversi\\u00f3n a largo plazo, tanto el oro como las acciones ofrecen ventajas \\u00fanicas, pero sirven para prop\\u00f3sitos muy diferentes. El oro suele considerarse una protecci\\u00f3n contra la inflaci\\u00f3n y la inestabilidad econ\\u00f3mica, mientras que las acciones se consideran veh\\u00edculos de crecimiento e ingresos.<br>La principal fortaleza del oro reside en su estabilidad. Con el tiempo, tiende a mantener su valor, lo que lo convierte en una reserva confiable de riqueza, en particular durante per\\u00edodos de volatilidad del mercado. Para los inversores que buscan una forma de preservar su capital en tiempos de incertidumbre, el oro es una opci\\u00f3n s\\u00f3lida.<br>Las acciones, por otro lado, ofrecen el potencial de obtener mayores retornos a largo plazo. Al invertir en acciones, en particular las de empresas en crecimiento, los inversores pueden beneficiarse de dividendos y apreciaci\\u00f3n del capital. Sin embargo, las acciones tienen una mayor volatilidad, lo que puede ser una desventaja durante las ca\\u00eddas del mercado.<br>La decisi\\u00f3n entre oro y acciones no tiene por qu\\u00e9 ser una elecci\\u00f3n entre una u otra. Muchos inversores utilizan una combinaci\\u00f3n de ambos para diversificar sus carteras. El oro puede actuar como una fuerza estabilizadora, mientras que las acciones impulsan el crecimiento. El equilibrio adecuado depende de sus objetivos de inversi\\u00f3n y tolerancia al riesgo.<\\/p>","tags":["Oro","Invertir"]},"ar":{"title":"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u0647\\u0628 \\u0645\\u0642\\u0627\\u0628\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0633\\u0647\\u0645: \\u0623\\u064a\\u0647\\u0645\\u0627 \\u0623\\u0641\\u0636\\u0644 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u062b\\u0645\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0637\\u0648\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0645\\u062f\\u061f","description":"<p>\\u0639\\u0646\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627 \\u064a\\u062a\\u0639\\u0644\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u062b\\u0645\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0648\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u062c\\u0644\\u060c \\u0641\\u0625\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u0647\\u0628 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0633\\u0647\\u0645 \\u064a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0632\\u0627\\u064a\\u0627 \\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u062f\\u0629\\u060c \\u0644\\u0643\\u0646\\u0647\\u0645\\u0627 \\u064a\\u062e\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u0646 \\u0623\\u063a\